# serializer version: 1
# name: test_an_unreadable_worktree_is_warned_about_rather_than_dropped
  'the worktree holding child could not be read, so whether a replay can run there is not known: fatal: bad object'
# ---
# name: test_explained_report_matches_snapshot[established-with-parent]
  '''
  git wheresat: boundary for child
    child tip   1111111
    target      7777777
    boundary    8888888
  
  Evidence
    attested  stack-record-birth       8888888  stack record
  
  Included (2 commits)
    1111111
    2222222
  
  Excluded (2 commits)
    3333333
    4444444
  
  Gates
    passed          parent-identity-matches
                    the parent head came from its own acme/widget
    passed          parent-merged
                    the parent merged at 2026-09-01T09:30:00Z
    passed          landed-reachable-from-target
                    6666666 is an ancestor of 7777777
    passed          boundary-is-ancestor-of-child
                    8888888 is an ancestor of 1111111
    passed          replay-range-non-empty
                    the replay range 8888888888888888888888888888888888888888..1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 holds 2 commits
    passed          parent-history-intact
                    8888888 is an ancestor of 5555555
    passed          replay-range-excludes-landed-work
                    8888888888888888888888888888888888888888..1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 holds no commit the parent head reaches
    passed          record-not-superseded
                    the record was written from the child's current tip
  
  Durability
    a ref that outlives this run already reaches the boundary
  
  Replay
    # back up the child tip first, then replay onto the target
    git update-ref refs/wheresat-backup/child 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111
    git rebase --onto 7777777777777777777777777777777777777777 8888888888888888888888888888888888888888 child
    # undo: git reset --hard refs/wheresat-backup/child
  
    Verify before running: the child tip must still be 1111111
  
  '''
# ---
# name: test_explained_report_matches_snapshot[established]
