                    the run did not set out to consult a parent pull request
    passed          boundary-is-ancestor-of-child
                    8888888 is an ancestor of 1111111
    passed          replay-range-non-empty
                    the replay range 8888888888888888888888888888888888888888..1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 holds 2 commits
    passed          parent-history-intact
                    8888888 is an ancestor of 5555555
    passed          replay-range-excludes-landed-work
                    8888888888888888888888888888888888888888..1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 holds no commit the parent head reaches
    passed          record-not-superseded
                    the record was written from the child's current tip
  
  Durability
    a ref that outlives this run already reaches the boundary
  
  Replay
    # back up the child tip first, then replay onto the target
    git update-ref refs/wheresat-backup/child 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111
    git rebase --onto 7777777777777777777777777777777777777777 8888888888888888888888888888888888888888 child
